OL,3,AZZ Top drummer Frank Beard dies aged 77
OL,4,
OL,5,FLongtime ZZ Top drummer Frank Beard has
OL,6,Fdied aged 77, the band said.
OL,8,FA statement on the blues-rock band's
OL,9,Fwebsite said he died on Monday in
OL,10,Fhospice care at his ranch in Richmond,
OL,11,FTexas, with family members at his side.
OL,12,FHis cause of death was not specified.
OL,14,FBeard's passing "necessitates the
OL,15,Fcancellation" of the band's tour dates
OL,16,Fthis week in Utah and Colorado, the
OL,17,Fstatement said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
